  "description": "WW.Cad.Net.8.0 multi-platform is a .NET 8.0 library to create, read, write, modify and display AutoCAD DWG and DXF files that runs on Windows, linux and MacOS. See https://www.woutware.com/cadlib-net for more information.",
  "iconFile": "docs\\images\\CadLib.png",
